WEBVTT

00:03:28.208 --> 00:03:30.684
And it's the context that changes,

00:03:30.708 --> 00:03:33.601
not the thinking about relationships.

00:03:33.625 --> 00:03:36.976
AG: Are you saying we don't become
fundamentally different human beings

00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:38.309
when we go to work?

00:03:38.333 --> 00:03:39.851
EP: Oh, you still believe that?

00:03:39.875 --> 00:03:42.684
AG: I don't. I just want to confirm
that you agree with me.

00:03:42.708 --> 00:03:45.393
EP: Of course. I think,
this is a very interesting thing.

00:03:45.417 --> 00:03:47.768
This notion that you bring --
There is two views.

00:03:47.792 --> 00:03:50.851
There's the view that says,
"You don't bring your life to work,"

00:03:50.875 --> 00:03:52.809
and I say, "What else do you come with?"

00:03:52.833 --> 00:03:55.143
We all have a resume
that is the official resume.

00:03:55.167 --> 00:03:58.351
And we all have our relational diary
that is the unofficial resume.

00:03:58.375 --> 00:03:59.643
And it all comes with you.

00:03:59.667 --> 00:04:02.684
And it shapes what expectations you have,